  "question": {
    "text": "A current loop, having two circular arcs joined by two radial lines is shown in the figure. It carries a current of <math><mn>10</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The magnetic field at point <math><mi>O</mi></math> will be close to:<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0203_d6a92d49751a.png\" />"
